  "question": "Using the full pre-task conversation, identify the historical requirements and message evidence that are relevant to the current client task. Exclude unrelated history and do not treat the current task itself as historical evidence.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 9,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Of the options, I liked the fourth one. However, the final sentence, “without you having to wait..”, seems to contain too many pauses.\n\nCould we make that part flow more smoothly while sounding inspiring and conveying a little pride, but without overacting?"
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 8,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "For delivery, please provide each track as a separate audio file; MP3 would be fine and sufficient.\n\nThank you for replying so quickly and for your interest in the project, Nadia. I look forward to receiving and hearing the tracks!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "After listening to the takes, I preferred **Take Seven**, especially because of the pauses. However, we would love to try four additional versions with even more energy and liveliness in the delivery.\n\nThe demo I’m sharing now is AI-generated and is intended only as a reference for our target tone and energy. Of course, your vibrant voice will bring it to life much better!\n\nI also sincerely apologize for my delayed response. An emergency required me to take nine days off, and I truly appreciate your patience, effort, and the multiple takes you sent.\n\nAlthough we have a time difference, please tell me when you can record next Monday. I’ll make sure I’m online and responsive at that time.\n\nBest regards!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Because I have a few other quick projects ahead of yours, I should be able to begin your project in seven hours or so. I’ll notify you as soon as I start.\n\nGood morning from here, and I hope everything is okay on your end. Does that schedule sound good?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "All is well here, elhamdolellah—thank you so much! :)\n\nThat schedule works for me. Good luck with your other projects, and I’ll wait for your notification that you’ve started.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Work is starting now, Simone. If any questions come up, I’ll keep you posted.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "If anything comes up, Nadia, I’m here and available to answer questions.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I’ve now recorded seven takes and delivered them for review. They’re still raw and haven’t been edited, so please listen to all seven and tell me which one, if any, you prefer.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
